and the productive tax base.\nADVERTISEMENT\n\nInstead, the ANC executed a 30 year masterclass in structural vandalism.", "author": "LibsRcrazy", "created": 1787445654071, "profile_picture": "", "community": "TheDonald", "ad_tier": 2, "last_comment_author": "FreedomLubber", "is_video": false, "video_link": "", "is_new_user": false, "domain": "", "is_crosspost": false, "preview": "", "removal_source": "", "link": "", "author_flair_class": "", "is_removed": false, "media": {"resized_resolutions": [], "blurhash": "", "full_resolution": []}, "title": "S.Africa is now a trash dump", "last_comment_created": 1787457128682, "content": "<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" href=\"https://joehoft.com/south-africa-went-africas-jewell-trash-dump-30/\" target=\"_blank\">https://joehoft.com/south-africa-went-africas-jewell-trash-dump-30/</a></p>\n<p>South Africa was once the jewel of Africa \u2013 now it\u2019s Africa\u2019s Trash Dump.\nWhen the ANC assumed power in 1994, they inherited the most sophisticated economic engine on the African continent.</p>\n<p>They were handed a deep-water port network, a highly complex rail system that efficiently moved freight from the interior to the coast, an integrated national power grid that generated some of the cheapest electricity in the world, and a professional, rule-bound civil service.</p>\n<p>That system possessed underlying engineering and administrative principles that were globally competitive.</p>\n<p>The historical task of the new government was simple: maintain the existing engineering standards, scale the capacity to include the black majority, and expand the productive tax base.\nADVERTISEMENT</p>\n<p>Instead, the ANC executed a 30 year masterclass in structural vandalism.</p>\n", "score_down": 0, "author_flair_text": "", "pro_tier": 0, "is_stickied": false, "is_nsfw": false, "is_deleted": false, "is_image": false, "comments": 1, "score_up": 25, "is_edited": false, "is_moderator": false, "awards": 0, "vote_state": 2, "link_metadata": {"st